{{!
    @template mod_playerpuzzle/opponent_card_body

    What an opponent is and fights with: its picture, its name, where in the Campaign it is fought and one line
    for each thing that sets it apart. Shared by the shop's card and the dialog opened during the fight.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name - The opponent's name
    * spriteurl - The opponent's picture
    * phasetext - Level and phase, empty outside a Campaign
    * traits - One entry for each thing that sets it apart, each with text

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Goblin",
        "spriteurl": "/mod/playerpuzzle/pix/opponents/goblin.webp",
        "phasetext": "Level 1, Phase 2",
        "traits": [
            {"text": "It hits 15% harder."},
            {"text": "Ambush: on the opponent's first turn, its Swords deal double damage."}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="pp-opponent-card-body">
    <img class="pp-opponent-card-image" src="{{spriteurl}}" alt="" width="72" height="72">
    <div>
        <strong class="pp-opponent-card-name">{{name}}</strong>
        {{#phasetext}}
        <span class="pp-opponent-card-phase">{{phasetext}}</span>
        {{/phasetext}}
        <ul class="pp-opponent-card-traits">
            {{#traits}}
            <li>{{text}}</li>
            {{/traits}}
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
